      "changelog": "Initial release of 英语口语活动设计 skill:\n\n- Provides workflow and templates for systematic English speaking lesson design based on Task-Based Language Teaching (TBLT)\n- Focuses on task-driven, contextualized, and scaffolded oral English activities (e.g., information gap, role-play, debate)\n- Includes clear teacher-facing boundaries: no direct AI speaking practice, no unauthorized material copying, and only offers assessment frameworks (not grading)\n- Integrates with lesson planning, student analysis, and classroom coaching skills for data and workflow connection\n- Designed to help teachers foster fluency, accuracy, and appropriacy through actionable, feedback-rich activities",
